        "body": "GitHub is shipping early access to Stacked PRs, it requires submitting a form: https://github.github.com/gh-stack/\n\nI could just submit the form but I don't think my role as collaborator necessarily gives me the entitlement to do that for us. Honestly this is probably something we can just do - maybe a TSC member should! - but I didn't want to overstep.",
